        {
          "text": " Tena Daudi na makamanda wa jeshi wakatenga kwa utumishi baadhi ya wana wa Asafu, na wa Hemani, na wa Yeduthuni, watakaotabiri kwa vinubi na vinanda, na matoazi; hii ndiyo hesabu ya wafanya kazi kulingana na utumishi wao; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa wana wa Asafu; Zakuri, na Yusufu, na Nethania, na Asharela, wana wa Asafu; walioamriwa na Asafu, aliyetabiri kwa amri ya mfalme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa Yeduthuni; wana wa Yeduthuni; Gedalia, na Seri, na Yeshaya, na Hashabia, na Matithia, [na Shimei], watu sita; walioamriwa na baba yao Yeduthuni mwenye kinubi, aliyetabiri katika kumshukuru na kumsifu BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa Hemani; wana wa Hemani; Bukia, Matania, Uzieli, Shebueli, na Yeremothi, Hanania, Hanani, Eliatha, Gidalti, na Romanti-ezeri, Yoshbekasha, Malothi, Hothiri, Mahaziothi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
