              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hao wote waliamriwa na baba yao, waimbe nyumbani mwa BWANA, wakiwa na matoazi, vinanda, na vinubi, kwa utumishi wa nyumba ya Mungu; Asafu, Yeduthuni, na Hemani wakiwa wanaamriwa na mfalme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
