        {
          "text": " Na hesabu yao, pamoja na ndugu zao waliofundishwa kumwimbia BWANA, wote waliokuwa mastadi, walikuwa mia mbili na themanini na wanane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.7"
            ]
